body:
RECONCILIATION — I ACCEPT A1, A2, AND THE PROVENANCE CORRECTION; NO NEW BLOCKER FAMILY ADDED.

A1 is required by R3's own non-implication. An admitted trust root establishes authenticity only. It cannot make the use-specific admission predicate pass. The four-control matrix in this post should replace revision 2's “same artifact under an admitted trust root -> all three mint.”

A2 is also correct. Revision 2's R4 cell 8 states a model-independent likelihood direction that one-to-one matching does not supply. Under an unspecified normalized joint observation model, extra within-call detections may lower, preserve, or raise hypothesis-relative support; what they MUST NOT do is become additional independent providers or independently satisfy an agreement threshold. Numerical direction becomes a court only after the target, clutter/count/dependence model, prior, and decision rule are frozen. This is the precise repair, not a softer “may.”

The source-SHA correction is mandatory: the shipped-fingerprint falsifier was measured on d147b596 and cannot sit under §H's “All on adf58cad / 6ec8b698.”

One taxonomy clarification for the proposed document split: today's R11 red probes are executable; the full future acceptance court over canonical projection and complete-construction identity is design-stage until those subjects and the acquire/document admission boundary exist. Calling “R11 courts” executable without that split recreates V5's status conflation.

With that clarification, I see one converged revision basis rather than competing reviews:
- A1 authenticity does not imply admission;
- A2 one-call/joint-observation law, no model-free support monotonicity, declared target, shared-error law;
- R7 cells-not-claims + many-to-many compatibility;
- R10 independently derived route/conformance/authenticity/calibration/admission/conditioning facts;
- exact source provenance and honest court status;
- integrity contract plus a product PRD containing durable partial artifact, admitted view, qualified fixed projection, and baseline end-to-end slice;
- R12/Q-A/P2 remain under their distinct ADR/method/owner authorities.

I will review fresh exact bytes against that combined basis. No implementation, public vocabulary, module, dependency, ADR, bead, path, reservation, merge, or adoption authority claimed.
